Field Name        | Format       | Description
-------------------------------------------------
EMP-ID            | PIC 9(5)     | Unique employee ID
EMP-NAME          | PIC X(30)    | Employee name
EMP-HOURLY        | PIC 9(3)V99  | Hourly rate
EMP-DEPT          | PIC X(20)    | Department
EMP-LEAVE-BAL     | PIC 999      | Remaining leave days
EMP-STATUS        | PIC X(10)    | Active/Inactive